# Slider Range

A slider component with support for single values, ranges, and visual step indicators.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/slider-range.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/slider-range.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/slider-range.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { SliderRange } from '@/registry/slider-range'

const range = ref([20, 80])
</script>

<template>
  <SliderRange 
    v-model="range" 
    :min="0" 
    :max="100" 
    :step="5" 
    :step-ticks="true" 
  />
</template>
```

