### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `min` | `number` | `0` | Minimum value. |
| `max` | `number` | `100` | Maximum value. |
| `step` | `number` | `1` | Increment step. |
| `stepTicks` | `boolean` | `false` | Show visual markers for each step. |
| `v-model` | `number \| number[]` | `[0]` | The current value or range of values. |
| `class` | `string` | `undefined` | Additional classes for the container. |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` | Disable the slider. |
| `orientation` | `string` | `'horizontal'` | Slider orientation (`'horizontal'` or `'vertical'`). |
